  "notes": "Refers to excessive drinking on a specific occasion, not habitual alcoholism. For chronic heavy drinking, {大酒|おおざけ}{飲|の}み or アルコール{依存症|いぞんしょう} would be more appropriate.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {深酒|ふかざけ}する (to drink excessively)\n- {深酒|ふかざけ}がたたる (to suffer the consequences of heavy drinking)\n- {深酒|ふかざけ}を{控|ひか}える (to refrain from heavy drinking)\n\nUSAGE:\n{深酒|ふかざけ} typically describes a single occasion of overdrinking rather than a pattern. It often appears in the context of regretting the next morning.",
